{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:15DXFeedFramework15ScheduleSessionC","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ScheduleSession","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"ScheduleSession","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScheduleSession"}],"modules":[{"name":"DXFeedFramework"}],"roleHeading":"Class","symbolKind":"class"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/documentation\/DXFeedFramework"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/documentation\/DXFeedFramework\/ScheduleSession","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/SQ","doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/s9EscapableP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Session represents a continuous period of time during which apply same rules regarding trading activity.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For example, regular trading session is a period of time consisting of one day of business activities","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in a financial market, from the opening bell to the closing bell, when regular trading occurs.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScheduleSession"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sessions can be either trading or non-trading, with different sets of rules and reasons to exist."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Sessions do not overlap with each other - rather they form consecutive chain of adjacent periods of time that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cover entire time scale. The point on a border line is considered to belong to following session that starts there."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Each session completely fits inside a certain day. Day may contain sessions with zero duration - e.g. indices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that post value once a day. Such sessions can be of any appropriate type, trading or non-trading."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/dxfeedframework\/schedulesession"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/documentation\/DXFeedFramework\/ScheduleSession\/endTime","doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/documentation\/DXFeedFramework\/ScheduleSession\/isTrading","doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/documentation\/DXFeedFramework\/ScheduleSession\/startTime","doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/documentation\/DXFeedFramework\/ScheduleSession\/type","doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/documentation\/DXFeedFramework\/ScheduleSession\/yearMonthDay"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/documentation\/DXFeedFramework\/ScheduleSession\/getNext(filter:)","doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/documentation\/DXFeedFramework\/ScheduleSession\/getPrevious(filter:)","doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/documentation\/DXFeedFramework\/ScheduleSession\/toString()"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework\/documentation\/DXFeedFramework\/ScheduleSession\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"references":{"doc://com.dxfeed.DXFeedFramework/documentation/DXFeedFramework/ScheduleSession/toString()":{"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.dxfeed